# Snippets and tricks for browsers


>> Choosing browser

> Security / Privacy
* https://privacytests.org/                         # various metrics 
* https://sizeof.cat/post/web-browser-telemetry/    # in consideration of telemetry


>> Tweaking

> General
* document.getElementsByTagName("video")[0].playbackRate = 4  # Javascript command to run in console - change youtube playback speed (example here: x4)
* greasyfork.org  : URL for source of scripts to run on your ViolentMonkey add-on/plugin

> Chromium-based
* chrome://flags/#hardware-media-key-handling  : URL for advanced operation flags. Specifically media-key-handline - disable this to get rid of the banner that appears when you change audio-volume



>> Search engines

> Google
* Clean "Web" search results without extra suggestions and summaries: add the following to the options of the URL / get-request (possibly at the end):   &udm=14




